-- then reordered by hand so it runs on a database that already has appointments: drizzle-kit adds
-- appointments.practitioner_id as NOT NULL in one step, which every existing row would fail. Instead the column is
-- added nullable, every appointments business gets one practitioner, every existing appointment is pointed at it,
